### create user

POST http://localhost:8800/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Smith",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "AnotherPassword456"
}

### Log user
POST http://localhost:8800/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "AnotherPassword456"
}